{
  "title": { "zh": "挡板后面", "en": "Behind the screen" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "在<level-ref to=\"0C1\"></level-ref>里，图上看得见的东西也可能有几种解释。这一关场景里立着一块不透明的挡板，挡住了它后面的东西：被<wiki-ref to=\"occlusion\"></wiki-ref>的部分，图里一个像素也没有。题目照样给出一张图和几个都渲得出它的候选场景。",
        "en": "In <level-ref to=\"0C1\"></level-ref> even what the image shows allowed several explanations. Here an opaque screen stands in the scene and hides what is behind it: a part lost to <wiki-ref to=\"occlusion\"></wiki-ref> has not one pixel in the image. As before you get the image and several candidate scenes that all render it."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "这一关新在看不见的东西：图里看不到的，图像能说明它是什么吗？关于看得见的物体和关于挡板后面的话，都按候选场景判断，每个场景里都对才算成立，每个场景里都错才算不成立。",
        "en": "What is new is the unseen: can an image say what something it does not show is? Statements about the visible objects and about what is behind the screen are judged alike against the candidate scenes: true in every one, they hold; false in every one, they do not."
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "0C2",
      "kind": "choice",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "挡板挡住了场景的一部分：判断每句话成立、不成立，还是无法确定。",
        "en": "A screen hides part of the scene: judge whether each statement holds, does not hold, or is undetermined."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "露出来的一角只说明那里有东西、是什么颜色；它后面还连着什么，图里没有。",
          "en": "A corner showing says only that something is there and what colour it is; what it is attached to behind the screen is not in the image."
        },
        {
          "zh": "一个东西整个藏在挡板后面时，图里连「没有它」也看不出来。",
          "en": "When something hides entirely behind the screen, the image cannot even show that it is absent."
        }
      ],
      "judge": "claims",
      "rounds": [
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": {
                "zh": "挡板右边露出一角的东西是一辆车。",
                "en": "The thing whose corner shows at the screen's right is a car."
              },
              "claim": { "class": { "object": "thing", "is": "car" } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "露出一角的东西是蓝色的。", "en": "The thing whose corner shows is blue." },
              "claim": { "colour": { "object": "thing", "is": "blue" } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "场景里没有球。", "en": "There is no ball in the scene." },
              "claim": { "count": { "class": "ball", "n": 0 } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "挡板是红色的。", "en": "The screen is red." },
              "claim": { "colour": { "object": "screen", "is": "red" } }
            }
          ],
          "scenes": [
            {
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 5, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 50 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "screen",
                  "class": "screen",
                  "colour": "grey",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [0, 0.6, 1], "size": [2, 1.6, 0.1] }]
                },
                {
                  "id": "thing",
                  "class": "car",
                  "colour": "blue",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [1.25, 0.3, -1], "size": [1.5, 0.6, 1] }]
                },
                {
                  "id": "ball",
                  "class": "ball",
                  "colour": "blue",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [-0.4, 0.3, -0.5], "size": [0.4, 0.4, 0.4] }]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 5, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 50 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "screen",
                  "class": "screen",
                  "colour": "grey",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [0, 0.6, 1], "size": [2, 1.6, 0.1] }]
                },
                {
                  "id": "thing",
                  "class": "crate",
                  "colour": "blue",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [1.6, 0.3, -0.7], "size": [0.8, 0.6, 0.4] }]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "挡板后面有一只狗。", "en": "There is a dog behind the screen." },
              "claim": { "exists": { "class": "dog" } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "最左边的箱子在画面里看得见。", "en": "The crate at the far left shows in the picture." },
              "claim": { "visible": { "object": "crate" } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "场景里没有猫。", "en": "There is no cat in the scene." },
              "claim": { "count": { "class": "cat", "n": 0 } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "最左边的箱子是绿色的。", "en": "The crate at the far left is green." },
              "claim": { "colour": { "object": "crate", "is": "green" } }
            }
          ],
          "scenes": [
            {
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 5, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 50 },
              "objects": [
                {
